<item>
<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-06T16:04:54.566Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 16:04:54 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Kashmir are conducting joint area domination exercises in Bandipora and Sopore along the Wullar axis as IGP Sujit Kumar warns that a single local terrorist remains active while the broader terror threat persists. In Manipur, hundreds rallied in Ukhrul demanding an end to ethnic violence and the SoO pact, while Naga groups petitioned the prime minister for a political solution and security forces launched operations to track perpetrators of recent violence. Maoist units in Chhattisgarh's Bijapur forest have hidden large caches, with forces recovering 711 BGL shells and a 5 kg pressure-cooker IED. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Outlook India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPcTl5TVlnd3h3Z0lhRl9tRVp1Qlpfd0JhdWNCUDdlV05GOVFvaDlhNHBvaFpETmtxeC12c2hBODZLNUNmSUxZYlZKc204RjFDUkFNVVFoaW1ZT1p5Mm5CVzY5MVhVTEYzTkN2R3RQTFNnOVZNcU5TdVAzZTJLaWNUV1lxSkdxb3oxZ0UydzFXZ1dmZTR1b1Y0eVJLeHRWOHAwNHRJLUVPTWlhRHhmM1JoZWZMNEF3NGEtb1VuTVJB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tripura Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today NE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPdy1Cc0pGNFFNS0oxQ2ZlSktGZ0wwUmRFeml1dUVxMmZjWm1lV2l4a256NXlPX2NwUXdOUzAtRl9pZ3YwYTducDBVSm9sbDJGTk1HeWZ5T1RQX25nR2VNaXU0LUxFc0g4cmRhOGtFbGJwdDlKOFRQQ3RIRHk5d0xLUm8tVmhwRHA1MkdmOTJaRnh3T0NZb2UtN0JKcHpHV1Jia2d2WXpSVjYtN0lMME1n?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Independent Media Service&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBM